# Trust: Bastok (bastok 92): the other nations' trust NPCs read this quest completed (status reads in their own
# scripts). Completed through this quest (434 option 2, Naji's 980, Prog 2 by GM, 982). Then Bastok's completed alone
# decides each: Gondebaud's 3504 (Windurst's available) and Wetata's 867 (San d'Oria's available), option 0; with Trust:
# Windurst accepted by GM, Kupipi's 439 (San d'Oria's available; its finish completes Trust: Windurst); Trust: Windurst
# made available again by GM and Trust: San d'Oria accepted: Excenmille's 897 (Windurst's not completed; its finish
# completes Trust: San d'Oria).
# Kupipi+1: Heaven's Tower has two Kupipis; the first (17768466) is cutscene_only, the second the one a char talks to.
lists PortBastok/Clarion_Star/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/434 Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/980 Metalworks/onEventFinish/982
char zone=PortBastok pos=81.5,7.5,-24.2 lvl=5 nation=1
login
trigger Clarion_Star           # 434
finish option=2                # begun, the card
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Naji                   # 980
finish                         # Naji learned, Prog 1
charvar Quest[1][92]Prog 2     # GM: the Naji trust's cast in Gustaberg
trigger Naji                   # 982
finish                         # completed
warp 123.7,0,92.1 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Gondebaud              # Bastok's completed, Windurst's available: 3504
finish                         # option 0: nothing
warp -23.8,2.5,-44.6 WindurstWoods
trigger Wetata                 # Bastok's completed, San d'Oria's available: 867
finish                         # option 0: nothing
quest Windurst.TrustWindurst accepted
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower
trigger Kupipi+1               # Windurst's accepted, Bastok's completed, San d'Oria's available: 439
finish                         # Kupipi's script: Kupipi learned, Trust: Windurst completed
quest Windurst.TrustWindurst available
quest Sandoria.TrustSandoria accepted
warp -229.3,7,23 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Excenmille             # San d'Oria's accepted, Bastok's completed, Windurst's available: 897
finish                         # Excenmille's script: Excenmille learned, Trust: San d'Oria completed
